        "answer": "Constructs CoD.ArmorBarWZ.new with the exact receiver/menu/controller/layout arguments below. Creates self as LUI.UIElement.new, Border as LUI.UIImage.new, Frame as CoD.StartMenuOptionsMainFrame.new, ArmorBackground as LUI.UIImage.new, ArmorImage as LUI.UIImage.new, ArmorFrame as LUI.UIImage.new. Stores source state predicates in order Visible, VisibleWithoutBacking. Requests model links self, \"armorTier\", true; self, \"armorTier\", true; self, \"armorTier\", true; self, \"armor\", true. Owns 10 nested callable scopes, each with its separate delivery/invocation contract. Registers LUI.OverrideFunction_CallOriginalSecond( self, \"close\", self.__onClose ). Runs PostLoadFunc( self, f1_arg1, f1_arg0 ) only under its exact guard and at its original source position. All property/asset/model/state/navigation/return effects remain in the ordered statement contract; construction and storing callbacks do [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
